        "description": "This API endpoint enables partners to update configuration of a specific webhook subscription by its unique subscription ID. This allows for granular modifications to individual subscriptions without affecting other webhooks or recreating the subscription. Common use cases include updating webhook URLs, changing event modes, modifying metadata, or toggling subscription status."
